      en: ["Duékoué is the capital of the Guémon region within the Montagnes District.", "The city is considered the 'gateway to the deep west' of Ivory Coast.", "Major roads lead from here to the cities of Man, Daloa, and San Pédro.", "The region around Duékoué is part of the country's prominent 'cocoa belt'.", "The name Duékoué means 'place of peace' in the language of the Wê people.", "Forestry is the second most important economic sector after cocoa farming."],
