      en: ["Capital city of the Bafing Region in western Ivory Coast.", "Principal cultural center of the Mahouka (Malinké) ethnic group.", "Located in close proximity to the international border with Guinea.", "The region is noted for its significant tobacco cultivation.", "Surrounded by the southern foothills of the Nimba mountain range.", "Major religious site featuring numerous traditional Quranic schools."],
